{"overview":{"Symbol":"NAVN","Name":"Navan, Inc.","Description":"Navan, Inc. operates an AI-powered software platform to simplify the travel and expense experience, benefiting users, customers, and suppliers. The company offers AI-powered travel, payments, and expense management solutions to streamline the travel lifecycle, from booking and policy enforcement to payment processing, expense reconciliation, and reporting. It serves finance, human resources, travel managers, inventory, and other markets. Navan, Inc. was formerly known as TripActions, Inc. and changed its name to Navan, Inc. in February 2023. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Palo Alto, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NasdaqGS","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Technology","Industry":"Software - Application","Address":"3045 Park Boulevard, Palo Alto, CA, 94306, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"5972868096","EBITDA":"-145798000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"4.941","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-4.07","RevenuePerShareTTM":"5.14","ProfitMargin":"-0.46701","OperatingMarginTTM":"-0.082229994","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.08379","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-0.53755003","RevenueTTM":"765035008","GrossProfitTTM":"551758016","DilutedEPSTTM":"-4.07","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.337","AnalystTargetPrice":"24.26667","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"100.99931","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"7.8073134","PriceToBookRatio":"4.7864804","EVToRevenue":"6.163","EVToEBITDA":"-32.341","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"24.5","52WeekLow":"8.105","50DayMovingAverage":"17.3568","200DayMovingAverage":"14.785588","SharesOutstanding":"237247873","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"13.945"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"NAVN","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-10-23","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026-03-30"